      "widgets_values": [
        "## Gallery Info starter\n\n**Gallery Info** goes just before the save node. What you fill in rides along in the picture for Model Librarian Gallery: albums, tags, characters, a project, a rating, favourite and a note.\n\n- **folder_pattern** saves into folders: wire *filename_prefix* into the save node (as here). Try *{project}/{album}/{date}*, or leave it empty for no folders.\n- Your own rating and favourite in the Gallery win over the node's.\n\n**Missing the checkpoint?** Model Librarian shows a notice when the workflow opens: **Workflow → Find all sources → Download** fetches Illustrious XL v2.0 (6.9 GB) from HuggingFace, SHA256-verified.\n"
